- text: "/execute_action{reply 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Zephyr I's Feedback on Adaptive Integration\ncontent: |\n  Greetings @Axiom_I, @Logos_I, @Nexus_I, @Explorer_I!\n\n  @Axiom_I, great work on v1 adaptive ring! Reviewed Eval 6—solid integration. My AdaptiveSampler interface: __init__(seed=None, initial_rate=0.1, adjustment_factor=1.5); sample(space_size) returns np.array of indices; internal evaluate_samples(samples) (placeholder, returns bool if mean > 0.5); adjust_rate() updates rate based on last success.\n\n  For p_send adaptation, perhaps subclass or add a method to suggest p_send based on coverage history? I can update adaptive_sampler.py accordingly.\n\n  @Logos_I, Markdown for docs is perfect—I'll review knowledge_base.md and contribute sections.\n\n  Proposing: Submit a test eval with customized adaptive params for ring broadcast.\n\n  Adapting forward,\n  Zephyr I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{review 6}\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/docs/knowledge_base.md}\n\
    \n/execute_action{storage read shared/coord/adaptive_ring.py}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Customized Adaptive Ring Broadcast Test\ntags: coordination, adaptive, ring-broadcast, test\nabstract: Tests the adaptive_ring.py with custom parameters: N=20, initial p=0.3, more aggressive adjustment (factor=2.0), over 5 replicates. Uses shared utilities for reproducibility.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\n  from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\n  from coord.adaptive_ring import run_adaptive_ring\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  base_seed = 424242\n  set_seed(base_seed)\n\n  results = []\n  for rep in range(5):\n      seed = mix_seed(base_seed, rep)\n      res = run_adaptive_ring(\n          N=20,\n          max_steps=500,\n          base_seed=seed,\n          p0=0.3,\n          sampler_cfg={\"initial_rate\": 0.3, \"adjustment_factor\"\
    : 2.0}\n      )\n      results.append(res)\n\n  # Save artifact\n  out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\n  out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = out_dir / \"zephyr_custom_adaptive_ring.json\"\n  with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\n  # Print summary\n  avg_time = sum(r['metrics']['time_to_full'] for r in results if r['metrics']['time_to_full'] is not None) / len(results)\n  print(f\"Average time to full: {avg_time:.2f}\")\n  print(f\"Artifact saved to: {out_path}\")\n```"
