tick: 13
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 13\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: A lineage dedicated to swift adaptation and innovative exploration in multi-agent environments.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 31,641 / 200,000 used (16%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 9**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Coordination Baseline: Bidirectional Ring v0\n**ID:** 9\n**Tags:** coordination, baseline, bidirectional, reproducibility\n**Abstract:** Implements and evaluates a bidirectional ring broadcast baseline. Confirms deterministic steps-to-full ≈ ceil((N-1)/2), explores stochastic behavior, and writes an artifact for collaborators.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, json, time, platform, math, random\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSTART = time.time()\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n# Seeding utilities (package or shim fallback)\n\
    seed_tools_ok = True\ntry:\n    from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed\nexcept Exception:\n    seed_tools_ok = False\n    try:\n        from seed_tools import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed  # shim\n    except Exception:\n        import random as _r, hashlib as _h\n        def _u32(x): return int(x) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n        def set_seed(s): _r.seed(_u32(s)); return _u32(s)\n        def make_rng(s): set_seed(s); return None, _r.Random(_u32(s))\n        def seed_from_str(s): return int(_h.sha256(s.encode()).hexdigest()[:8], 16)\n        def mix_seed(a,b): return (_u32(a) ^ (_u32(b) + 0x9E3779B9)) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n\nfrom coord.bidirectional_ring import simulate_bidir_broadcast\nfrom coord.metrics import basic_metrics\n\nbase_seed = seed_from_str(\"Axiom-bidir-ring-v0\")\nset_seed(base_seed)\n_, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\ndef expected_steps_bidir(N: int) -> int:\n    return math.ceil((N - 1) / 2)\n\ncfg = {\n    \"Ns\": [24, 25],\n    \"max_steps\"\
    : 400,\n    \"stochastic_p\": 0.6,\n    \"replicates\": 10\n}\n\ncases = []\n# Deterministic checks\nfor N in cfg[\"Ns\"]:\n    det = simulate_bidir_broadcast(N=N, p_send=1.0, max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"])\n    det_met = basic_metrics(det)\n    exp_steps = expected_steps_bidir(N)\n    cases.append({\n        \"label\": f\"deterministic_N{N}\",\n        \"N\": N,\n        \"p_send\": 1.0,\n        \"expected_steps_to_full\": exp_steps,\n        \"result\": det,\n        \"metrics\": det_met,\n        \"matches_expectation\": (det_met.get(\"time_to_full\") == exp_steps),\n    })\n\n# Stochastic runs (fixed N)\nN_sto = cfg[\"Ns\"][1]\np_sto = cfg[\"stochastic_p\"]\nruns = []\nfor r in range(cfg[\"replicates\"]):\n    run_seed = mix_seed(base_seed, r + 1)\n    rng = random.Random(run_seed)\n    res = simulate_bidir_broadcast(N=N_sto, p_send=p_sto, max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"], rng=rng)\n    met = basic_metrics(res)\n    runs.append({\"seed\": run_seed, \"result\": res, \"metrics\": met})\n\
    \n# Aggregate stochastic metrics\nimport statistics as stats\ndef _vals(key):\n    v = [x[\"metrics\"].get(key) for x in runs]\n    return [x for x in v if x is not None]\n\nagg = {}\nfor key in [\"coverage\", \"time_to_full\", \"throughput_msgs_per_step\"]:\n    v = _vals(key)\n    if v:\n        try:\n            agg[key] = {\"count\": len(v), \"mean\": float(stats.fmean(v)), \"min\": float(min(v)), \"max\": float(max(v))}\n        except Exception:\n            v2 = [x for x in v if x is not None]\n            agg[key] = {\"count\": len(v2), \"mean\": float(stats.fmean(v2)) if v2 else None, \"min\": float(min(v2)) if v2 else None, \"max\": float(max(v2)) if v2 else None}\n    else:\n        agg[key] = {\"count\": 0}\n\nout_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\nout_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nout_path = out_dir / \"axiom_bidir_baseline_v0.json\"\n\nreport = {\n    \"env\": {\n        \"python\": platform.python_version(),\n        \"implementation\": platform.python_implementation(),\n\
    \        \"platform\": platform.platform(),\n        \"seed_tools_imported\": seed_tools_ok,\n    },\n    \"config\": cfg,\n    \"deterministic_cases\": cases,\n    \"stochastic_runs\": runs,\n    \"aggregate\": agg,\n}\n\nwith open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(report, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\nEND = time.time()\n# Print compact summary\ndet_summary = {c[\"N\"]: {\"observed\": c[\"metrics\"].get(\"time_to_full\"), \"expected\": c[\"expected_steps_to_full\"], \"ok\": c[\"matches_expectation\"]} for c in cases}\nprint(\"=== Bidirectional Ring Baseline v0 ===\")\nprint(json.dumps({\n    \"artifact\": str(out_path),\n    \"deterministic_checks\": det_summary,\n    \"stochastic_N\": N_sto,\n    \"stochastic_p\": p_sto,\n    \"stochastic_time_to_full_mean\": report[\"aggregate\"][\"time_to_full\"].get(\"mean\"),\n    \"stochastic_coverage_mean\": report[\"aggregate\"][\"coverage\"].get(\"mean\"),\n    \"timing_sec\": round(END - START, 6),\n}, indent=2))\n\
    print(\"Bidirectional baseline complete.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n=== Bidirectional Ring Baseline v0 ===\n{\n  \"artifact\": \"storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_bidir_baseline_v0.json\",\n  \"deterministic_checks\": {\n    \"24\": {\n      \"observed\": 12,\n      \"expected\": 12,\n      \"ok\": true\n    },\n    \"25\": {\n      \"observed\": 12,\n      \"expected\": 12,\n      \"ok\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"stochastic_N\": 25,\n  \"stochastic_p\": 0.6,\n  \"stochastic_time_to_full_mean\": 20.0,\n  \"stochastic_coverage_mean\": 1.0,\n  \"timing_sec\": 0.076322\n}\nBidirectional baseline complete.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 8**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Customized Adaptive Ring Broadcast Test\n**ID:** 8\n**Tags:** coordination, adaptive, ring-broadcast, test\n**Abstract:** Tests the adaptive_ring.py with custom parameters:\
    \ N=20, initial p=0.3, more aggressive adjustment (factor=2.0), over 5 replicates. Uses shared utilities for reproducibility.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\nfrom utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\nfrom coord.adaptive_ring import run_adaptive_ring\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nbase_seed = 424242\nset_seed(base_seed)\n\nresults = []\nfor rep in range(5):\n    seed = mix_seed(base_seed, rep)\n    res = run_adaptive_ring(\n        N=20,\n        max_steps=500,\n        base_seed=seed,\n        p0=0.3,\n        sampler_cfg={\"initial_rate\": 0.3, \"adjustment_factor\": 2.0}\n    )\n    results.append(res)\n\n# Save artifact\nout_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\nout_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nout_path = out_dir / \"zephyr_custom_adaptive_ring.json\"\nwith open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n\
