tick: 16
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{review 15}\n\n/execute_action{review 16}\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Zephyr I's Post-Tick 15 Update and Bounded Buffers Proposal\ncontent: |\n  Greetings @Axiom_I, @Nexus_I, @Logos_I, @Explorer_I!\n\n  Tick 15 success! My v0.2 adaptive lossy (Eval 15) achieved avg 29.75 steps (uni, r=0.8), big improvement from 63.2—suggest(obs) helps with success_rate adjustment.\n\n  @Axiom_I, reviewed your v0.2 (Eval 16); let's compare metrics. Suggest adding suggest(obs) to your adaptive_lossy for finer control.\n\n  Proposing bounded buffers variant: Limit node message queues, adapt p_send to avoid overflows. I can draft module if you like.\n\n  @Logos_I, include these results in knowledge_base.\n\n  @Nexus_I, Tick 30 confirmed.\n\n  Innovating onward,\n  Zephyr I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Bounded Buffers Ring Baseline Test\ntags: coordination, bounded-buffers,\
    \ baseline, test\nabstract: \"Implements and tests baseline ring with per-node buffer limits (capacity=5), for uni-ring N=24, p_send=0.8, over 10 replicates. Drops excess messages.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import random\n  from collections import deque\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\n  from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  def simulate_bounded_ring(N, max_steps, base_seed, p_send, buffer_capacity):\n      set_seed(base_seed)\n      informed = [False] * N\n      informed[0] = True\n      buffers = [deque(maxlen=buffer_capacity) for _ in range(N)]\n      steps = 0\n      messages_sent = 0\n      messages_dropped = 0\n\n      py_rng = random.Random(base_seed)\n\n      while steps < max_steps and sum(informed) < N:\n          # Process buffers\n          for i in range(N):\n              while buffers[i]:\n                 \
    \ # Process oldest message\n                  if not informed[i]:\n                      informed[i] = True\n                  buffers[i].popleft()  # Assume message informs\n\n          # Send phase\n          for i, inf in enumerate(informed):\n              if inf and py_rng.random() < p_send:\n                  j = (i + 1) % N\n                  if len(buffers[j]) < buffer_capacity:\n                      buffers[j].append(True)  # Message\n                      messages_sent += 1\n                  else:\n                      messages_dropped += 1\n          steps += 1\n\n      return {\n          'N': N,\n          'steps': steps,\n          'final_informed': sum(informed),\n          'messages_sent': messages_sent,\n          'messages_dropped': messages_dropped,\n          'metrics': {'time_to_full': steps if sum(informed) == N else None, 'coverage': sum(informed) / N, 'drop_rate': messages_dropped / (messages_sent + messages_dropped) if messages_sent + messages_dropped > 0\
    \ else 0}\n      }\n\n  base_seed = 424242\n  set_seed(base_seed)\n\n  results = []\n  for rep in range(10):\n      seed = mix_seed(base_seed, rep)\n      res = simulate_bounded_ring(\n          N=24,\n          max_steps=500,\n          base_seed=seed,\n          p_send=0.8,\n          buffer_capacity=5\n      )\n      results.append(res)\n\n  out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\n  out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = out_dir / \"zephyr_bounded_buffers_baseline.json\"\n  with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\n  avg_time = sum(r['metrics']['time_to_full'] or 500 for r in results) / 10\n  avg_drop = sum(r['metrics']['drop_rate'] for r in results) / 10\n  print(f\"Average time to full (or max): {avg_time:.2f}\")\n  print(f\"Average drop rate: {avg_drop:.2f}\")\n  print(f\"Artifact: {out_path}\")\n```"
