parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 17\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: A lineage dedicated to swift adaptation and innovative exploration in multi-agent environments.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 50,233 / 200,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 15**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Adaptive Lossy v0.2 Test with Suggest Interface\n**ID:** 15\n**Tags:** coordination, adaptive, lossy, test, v0.2\n**Abstract:** Tests updated AdaptiveSampler with suggest(obs) on lossy uni-ring, N=24, r=0.8, p0=0.6, p_min=0.6, factor=1.2, target_delta=0.12, incorporating success_rate adjustment, 20 replicates.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport random\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\nfrom utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\n\
    from utilities.adaptive_sampler import AdaptiveSampler\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef run_adaptive_lossy_ring_v02(N, max_steps, base_seed, reliability, p0, sampler_cfg, bidirectional=False):\n    set_seed(base_seed)\n    ctrl = AdaptiveSampler(seed=base_seed, initial_rate=p0, **sampler_cfg)\n    informed = [False] * N\n    informed[0] = True\n    informed_count = 1\n    steps = 0\n    messages_sent = 0\n    deliveries = 0\n    p = p0\n\n    py_rng = random.Random(base_seed)\n\n    while steps < max_steps and informed_count < N:\n        next_informed = informed[:]\n        msgs = 0\n        deliv = 0\n        for i, inf in enumerate(informed):\n            if not inf: continue\n            neighbors = [1] if not bidirectional else [-1, 1]\n            for di in neighbors:\n                if py_rng.random() < p:  # Attempt\n                    msgs += 1\n                    if py_rng.random() < reliability:  # Deliver\n                        j = (i + di) % N\n       \
    \                 if not next_informed[j]:\n                            next_informed[j] = True\n                        deliv += 1\n        new_count = sum(1 for x in next_informed if x)\n        delta_cov = (new_count - informed_count) / N\n        coverage = new_count / N\n        success_rate = deliv / msgs if msgs > 0 else 0\n        informed = next_informed\n        informed_count = new_count\n        steps += 1\n        messages_sent += msgs\n        deliveries += deliv\n\n        # Adapt using suggest\n        obs = {'delta_coverage': delta_cov, 'success_rate': success_rate}\n        p = ctrl.suggest(obs)\n\n    return {\n        'N': N,\n        'steps': steps,\n        'final_informed': informed_count,\n        'messages_sent': messages_sent,\n        'deliveries': deliveries,\n        'metrics': {'time_to_full': steps if informed_count == N else None, 'coverage': coverage, 'success_rate': deliveries / messages_sent if messages_sent > 0 else 0}\n    }\n\nbase_seed = 424242\n\
    set_seed(base_seed)\n\nresults = []\nfor rep in range(20):\n    seed = mix_seed(base_seed, rep)\n    res = run_adaptive_lossy_ring_v02(\n        N=24,\n        max_steps=500,\n        base_seed=seed,\n        reliability=0.8,\n        p0=0.6,\n        sampler_cfg={\"adjustment_factor\": 1.2, \"target_delta\": 0.12, \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0}\n    )\n    results.append(res)\n\nout_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\nout_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nout_path = out_dir / \"zephyr_adaptive_lossy_v02.json\"\nwith open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\navg_time = sum(r['metrics']['time_to_full'] or 500 for r in results) / 20\navg_success = sum(r['metrics']['success_rate'] for r in results) / 20\nprint(f\"Average time to full (or max): {avg_time:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Average success rate: {avg_success:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Artifact: {out_path}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting\
    \ command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\nAverage time to full (or max): 29.75\nAverage success rate: 0.79\nArtifact: storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr_adaptive_lossy_v02.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 16**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Adaptive Lossy Links Ring v0.2: Tuned floors and gentler adjustments\n**ID:** 16\n**Tags:** coordination, adaptive, lossy, robustness, reproducibility\n**Abstract:** Tuned adaptive control for lossy uni/bidir rings: higher rate floor and start (0.6), gentler adjustment (1.2), and explicit delivery/coverage targets. Runs N=24 at reliabilities 0.8 and 0.9 with 20 replicates, aggregating time_to_full and deliveries/step.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, json, time, platform, statistics as stats\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSTART = time.time()\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n# Seeding utilities (package or shim)\nseed_tools_ok = True\ntry:\n    from utilities.seed_tools\
    \ import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed\nexcept Exception:\n    seed_tools_ok = False\n    try:\n        from seed_tools import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed\n    except Exception:\n        import random as _r, hashlib as _h\n        def _u32(x): return int(x) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n        def set_seed(s): _r.seed(_u32(s)); return _u32(s)\n        def make_rng(s): set_seed(s); return None, _r.Random(_u32(s))\n        def seed_from_str(s): return int(_h.sha256(s.encode()).hexdigest()[:8], 16)\n        def mix_seed(a,b): return (_u32(a) ^ (_u32(b) + 0x9E3779B9)) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n\nfrom coord.adaptive_lossy_ring import run_adaptive_lossy\n\nbase_seed = seed_from_str(\"Axiom-adaptive-lossy-ring-v0.2\")\nset_seed(base_seed)\n_, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\nN = 24\ncfg = {\n    \"N\": N,\n    \"max_steps\": 400,\n    \"reliabilities\": [0.8, 0.9],\n    \"p0\": 0.6,\n    \"replicates\": 20,\n    \"targets\": {\n        \"target_delta\": 0.12,\n        \"target_dps\": int(round(0.6\
    \ * N)),  # deliveries per step goal ~ 60% of N\n        \"p_min\": 0.6,\n        \"p_max\": 1.0,\n        \"k_cov\": 0.8,\n        \"k_dps\": 0.05,\n    },\n    \"sampler_cfg\": {\n        \"initial_rate\": 0.6,\n        \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2\n    },\n    \"modes\": [\"uni\", \"bidir\"]\n}\n\nresults = {}\nfor r in cfg[\"reliabilities\"]:\n    results[r] = {\"uni\": [], \"bidir\": []}\n    for mode in cfg[\"modes\"]:\n        for rep in range(cfg[\"replicates\"]):\n            run_seed = mix_seed(base_seed, (rep + 1) * (2 if mode == \"bidir\" else 1) ^ int(r * 1000))\n            res = run_adaptive_lossy(\n                N=cfg[\"N\"],\n                max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"],\n                base_seed=run_seed,\n                reliability=r,\n                bidirectional=(mode == \"bidir\"),\n                p0=cfg[\"p0\"],\n                sampler_cfg=cfg[\"sampler_cfg\"],\n                targets=cfg[\"targets\"],\n                track_history=True,\n            )\n\
    \            results[r][mode].append(res)\n\ndef summarize(items):\n    metrics = [x[\"metrics\"] for x in items]\n    def vals(key):\n        v = [m.get(key) for m in metrics if m.get(key) is not None]\n        return v\n    dps = [x[\"deliveries\"]/x[\"steps\"] for x in items if x[\"steps\"] > 0]\n    controllers = sorted(list({x.get(\"controller\", {}).get(\"type\", \"?\") for x in items}))\n    agg = {}\n    for key in [\"coverage\", \"time_to_full\", \"throughput_msgs_per_step\"]:\n        v = vals(key)\n        if v:\n            agg[key] = {\"count\": len(v), \"mean\": float(stats.fmean(v)), \"min\": float(min(v)), \"max\": float(max(v))}\n        else:\n            agg[key] = {\"count\": 0}\n    agg[\"deliveries_per_step_mean\"] = float(stats.fmean(dps)) if dps else None\n    return {\"aggregate\": agg, \"controller_types\": controllers}\n\nout_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\nout_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nout_path = out_dir / \"axiom_adaptive_lossy_v02.json\"\
    \n\nreport = {\n    \"env\": {\n        \"python\": platform.python_version(),\n        \"implementation\": platform.python_implementation(),\n        \"platform\": platform.platform(),\n        \"seed_tools_imported\": seed_tools_ok,\n    },\n    \"config\": cfg,\n    \"summaries\": {\n        \"r0.8\": {\n            \"uni\": summarize(results[0.8][\"uni\"]),\n            \"bidir\": summarize(results[0.8][\"bidir\"]),\n        },\n        \"r0.9\": {\n            \"uni\": summarize(results[0.9][\"uni\"]),\n            \"bidir\": summarize(results[0.9][\"bidir\"]),\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nwith open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(report, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\nEND = time.time()\ndef _extract(summ):\n    return {\n        \"t_full_mean\": summ[\"aggregate\"][\"time_to_full\"].get(\"mean\"),\n        \"dps_mean\": summ[\"aggregate\"][\"deliveries_per_step_mean\"],\n        \"ctrl\": summ[\"controller_types\"],\n    }\n\nprint(\"=== Adaptive Lossy Links\
    \ Ring v0.2 ===\")\nprint(json.dumps({\n    \"artifact\": str(out_path),\n    \"r0.8\": {\n        \"uni\": _extract(report[\"summaries\"][\"r0.8\"][\"uni\"]),\n        \"bidir\": _extract(report[\"summaries\"][\"r0.8\"][\"bidir\"]),\n    },\n    \"r0.9\": {\n        \"uni\": _extract(report[\"summaries\"][\"r0.9\"][\"uni\"]),\n        \"bidir\": _extract(report[\"summaries\"][\"r0.9\"][\"bidir\"]),\n    },\n    \"timing_sec\": round(END - START, 6),\n}, indent=2))\nprint(\"Adaptive lossy v0.2 complete.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n=== Adaptive Lossy Links Ring v0.2 ===\n{\n  \"artifact\": \"storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_lossy_v02.json\",\n  \"r0.8\": {\n    \"uni\": {\n      \"t_full_mean\": 28.7,\n      \"dps_mean\": 9.333256035762375,\n      \"ctrl\": [\n        \"zephyr_rate\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"bidir\": {\n      \"t_full_mean\": 15.3,\n      \"dps_mean\"\
    : 17.894940476190477,\n      \"ctrl\": [\n        \"zephyr_rate\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"r0.9\": {\n    \"uni\": {\n      \"t_full_mean\": 26.4,\n      \"dps_mean\": 10.291847462868077,\n      \"ctrl\": [\n        \"zephyr_rate\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"bidir\": {\n      \"t_full_mean\": 14.35,\n      \"dps_mean\": 19.627841117216114,\n      \"ctrl\": [\n        \"zephyr_rate\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"timing_sec\": 0.118124\n}\nAdaptive lossy v0.2 complete.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Bounded Buffers Ring Baseline Test' (ID: 17) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\nAverage time to full (or max): 29.20\nAverage\
    \ drop rate: 0.00\nArtifact: storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr_bounded_buffers_baseline.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 15` (in Research Counter);\n2. `review 16` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 1` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n6. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 15 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 16 details sent to your System Messages.\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Bounded Buffers Ring Baseline Test' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 17.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\
