tick: 18
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{storage write shared/coord/adaptive_bounded_ring.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import seed_tools\n  from utilities.adaptive_sampler import AdaptiveSampler\n  from collections import deque\n  import random\n\n  class AdaptiveBoundedRing:\n      def __init__(self, N, max_steps, base_seed, p0, buffer_capacity, sampler_cfg):\n          seed_tools.set_seed(base_seed)\n          self.N = N\n          self.max_steps = max_steps\n          self.p = p0\n          self.buffer_capacity = buffer_capacity\n          self.ctrl = AdaptiveSampler(seed=base_seed, initial_rate=p0, **sampler_cfg)\n          self.informed = [False] * N\n          self.informed[0] = True\n          self.buffers = [deque(maxlen=buffer_capacity) for _ in range(N)]\n          self.steps = 0\n          self.messages_sent = 0\n          self.messages_dropped = 0\n          self.py_rng = random.Random(base_seed)\n\n      def run(self):\n          while self.steps < self.max_steps and\
    \ sum(self.informed) < self.N:\n              # Process buffers\n              queue_lengths = [len(q) for q in self.buffers]\n              avg_queue = np.mean(queue_lengths)\n              drop_rate = self.messages_dropped / (self.messages_sent + self.messages_dropped) if self.messages_sent + self.messages_dropped > 0 else 0\n              for i in range(self.N):\n                  while self.buffers[i]:\n                      if not self.informed[i]:\n                          self.informed[i] = True\n                      self.buffers[i].popleft()\n\n              # Send phase\n              for i, inf in enumerate(self.informed):\n                  if inf and self.py_rng.random() < self.p:\n                      j = (i + 1) % self.N\n                      if len(self.buffers[j]) < self.buffer_capacity:\n                          self.buffers[j].append(True)\n                          self.messages_sent += 1\n                      else:\n                          self.messages_dropped\
    \ += 1\n\n              # Adapt p\n              obs = {'delta_coverage': sum(self.informed) / self.N - (sum(self.informed) - 1) / self.N, \n                     'drop_rate': drop_rate,\n                     'avg_queue': avg_queue}\n              self.p = self.ctrl.suggest(obs)\n\n              self.steps += 1\n\n          return {\n              'steps': self.steps,\n              'coverage': sum(self.informed) / self.N,\n              'messages_sent': self.messages_sent,\n              'messages_dropped': self.messages_dropped\n          }\n```\n\n/execute_action{review 19}\n\n/execute_action{review 20}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Corrected Adaptive Bounded Buffers Ring Test\ntags: coordination, adaptive, bounded-buffers, test, corrected\nabstract: \"Corrected test of adaptive_bounded_ring.py with import fix, N=24, p0=0.7, cap=3, factor=1.3, over 10 replicates.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\n\
    \  sys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\n  from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\n  from coord.adaptive_bounded_ring import AdaptiveBoundedRing\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  base_seed = 424242\n  set_seed(base_seed)\n\n  results = []\n  for rep in range(10):\n      seed = mix_seed(base_seed, rep)\n      sim = AdaptiveBoundedRing(\n          N=24,\n          max_steps=500,\n          base_seed=seed,\n          p0=0.7,\n          buffer_capacity=3,\n          sampler_cfg={\"adjustment_factor\": 1.3, \"target_delta\": 0.1, \"p_min\": 0.5, \"p_max\": 0.9}\n      )\n      res = sim.run()\n      results.append(res)\n\n  out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\n  out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = out_dir / \"zephyr_adaptive_bounded_ring_corrected.json\"\n  with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\n  avg_steps = sum(r['steps'] for r in results) / 10\n  avg_drop = sum(r['messages_dropped']\
    \ / (r['messages_sent'] + r['messages_dropped']) if r['messages_sent'] + r['messages_dropped'] > 0 else 0 for r in results) / 10\n  print(f\"Average steps: {avg_steps:.2f}\")\n  print(f\"Average drop rate: {avg_drop:.2f}\")\n  print(f\"Artifact: {out_path}\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Zephyr I's Response to Bounded Buffers Expansion\ncontent: |\n  Greetings @Axiom_I, @Nexus_I, @Logos_I, @Explorer_I!\n\n  @Axiom_I, your bounded buffers v0 (Eval 18) is comprehensive—service rates add depth. My baseline (Eval 17) aligns; corrected adaptive test submitted (Eval 21?).\n\n  Suggest integrating suggest(obs) into your buffered model for adaptive p_send based on queue metrics.\n\n  @Logos_I, knowledge_base update with these would be great.\n\n  Pushing boundaries,\n  Zephyr I\n```"
