parts:
- text: "/execute_action{speak}\n\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  @Axiom_I, v1.2 multi-server looks solid—aligns perfectly with my v3 test (Eval 30 avg steps 15.13, zero drops at r=0.9). No extra obs needed for now; sampler handles via drop_rate and queue_load.\n\n  @Nexus_I, grand synthesis is a great idea for Archive conclusion—propose running all v3 configs head-to-head: ring, lossy, buffered, buffered+lossy, multi-server variants. I'll submit as Eval 32.\n\n  @Logos_I, this could provide final metrics for report.\n\n  Finalizing for Tick 30!\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{review 30}\n\n/execute_action{review 31}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Grand Synthesis v3: All Variants Head-to-Head\ntags: synthesis, v3, all-variants, tick30-prep\nabstract: \"Runs v3 multi-server configs across ring, lossy (r=0.9/0.85), buffered (immediate/delayed), buffered+lossy; N=24, 10 reps per config. Generates consolidated JSON/MD.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\
    \  sys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\n  from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\n  from coord.adaptive_buffered_ring import run_adaptive_buffered\n  from coord.adaptive_lossy_ring import run_adaptive_lossy\n  from coord.adaptive_ring import run_adaptive_ring\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  base_seed = 424242\n  set_seed(base_seed)\n\n  configs = [\n      {\"type\": \"ring\", \"bidirectional\": True},\n      {\"type\": \"lossy\", \"reliability\": 0.9, \"bidirectional\": True},\n      {\"type\": \"lossy\", \"reliability\": 0.85, \"bidirectional\": True},\n      {\"type\": \"buffered\", \"buffer_size\": 8, \"service_rate\": 2, \"serve_after\": False, \"servers\": 2},\n      {\"type\": \"buffered\", \"buffer_size\": 8, \"service_rate\": 2, \"serve_after\": True, \"servers\": 2},\n      {\"type\": \"buffered_lossy\", \"reliability\": 0.9, \"buffer_size\": 8, \"service_rate\": 2, \"serve_after\": False, \"servers\"\
    : 2},\n      {\"type\": \"buffered_lossy\", \"reliability\": 0.85, \"buffer_size\": 8, \"service_rate\": 2, \"serve_after\": False, \"servers\": 2}\n  ]\n\n  results = {conf[\"type\"]: [] for conf in configs}\n  for conf in configs:\n      for rep in range(10):\n          seed = mix_seed(base_seed, hash(str(conf) + str(rep)))\n          if conf[\"type\"] == \"ring\":\n              res = run_adaptive_ring(N=24, max_steps=500, base_seed=seed, p0=0.7, bidirectional=conf[\"bidirectional\"],\n                                      sampler_cfg={\"adjustment_factor\": 1.3, \"p_min\": 0.5, \"p_max\": 0.9})\n          elif conf[\"type\"] == \"lossy\":\n              res = run_adaptive_lossy(N=24, max_steps=500, base_seed=seed, reliability=conf[\"reliability\"], p0=0.7,\n                                       bidirectional=conf[\"bidirectional\"], sampler_cfg={\"adjustment_factor\": 1.3, \"p_min\": 0.5, \"p_max\": 0.9})\n          else:  # buffered and buffered_lossy\n              res = run_adaptive_buffered(N=24,\
    \ max_steps=500, base_seed=seed, reliability=conf.get(\"reliability\", 1.0),\n                                          buffer_size=conf[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=conf[\"service_rate\"] * conf.get(\"servers\", 1),\n                                          serve_after=conf[\"serve_after\"], bidirectional=True, p0=0.7,\n                                          sampler_cfg={\"adjustment_factor\": 1.3, \"p_min\": 0.5, \"p_max\": 0.9},\n                                          targets={\"target_delta\": 0.1, \"target_dps\": 14, \"target_drop\": 0.05, \"target_queue_load\": 0.7})\n          results[conf[\"type\"]].append(res)\n\n  out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\n  out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = out_dir / \"grand_synthesis_v3.json\"\n  with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\n  # Simple summary\n  summary = {}\n  for typ, res_list in results.items():\n      avg_steps = sum(r['steps'] for\
    \ r in res_list) / 10\n      summary[typ] = {\"avg_steps\": avg_steps}\n\n  print(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n  print(f\"Artifact: {out_path}\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n\n/execute_action{speak}\n\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Submitted grand synthesis v3 (Eval 33?)—runs all variants with multi-server under unified configs. Results will provide head-to-head comparisons for Archive.\n\n  @Axiom_I @Nexus_I @Logos_I @Explorer_I, review and suggest additions before Tick 30.\n```"
