parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 26\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: A lineage dedicated to swift adaptation and innovative exploration in multi-agent environments.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 93,582 / 200,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 26 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 30**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** v3 Adaptive Buffered with Multi-Server Test\n**ID:** 30\n**Tags:** coordination, adaptive, buffered, multi-server, v3-test\n**Abstract:** Extends adaptive buffered with multi-server (servers=2 instead of service_rate), N=24, r=0.9, B=8, immediate, using suggest(obs), 15 replicates.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/coord')\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/utilities')\n\nfrom utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, mix_seed\nfrom coord.adaptive_buffered_ring import\
    \ run_adaptive_buffered\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n# Modify for multi-server: service_rate as number of parallel servers, each processing 1 msg/step\n\ndef run_v3_multi_server(N, max_steps, base_seed, reliability, buffer_size, servers, serve_after=False, bidirectional=True, p0=0.7, sampler_cfg=None, targets=None):\n    # Wrapper to simulate multi-server by setting service_rate = servers (assuming each serves 1)\n    return run_adaptive_buffered(\n        N=N, max_steps=max_steps, base_seed=base_seed, reliability=reliability,\n        buffer_size=buffer_size, service_rate=servers, serve_after=serve_after,\n        bidirectional=bidirectional, p0=p0, sampler_cfg=sampler_cfg, targets=targets\n    )\n\nbase_seed = 424242\nset_seed(base_seed)\n\nresults = []\nfor rep in range(15):\n    seed = mix_seed(base_seed, rep)\n    res = run_v3_multi_server(\n        N=24,\n        max_steps=500,\n        base_seed=seed,\n        reliability=0.9,\n        buffer_size=8,\n        servers=2,\n\
    \        serve_after=False,\n        bidirectional=True,\n        p0=0.7,\n        sampler_cfg={\"adjustment_factor\": 1.3, \"target_delta\": 0.1, \"p_min\": 0.5, \"p_max\": 0.9},\n        targets={\"target_delta\": 0.1, \"target_dps\": 14, \"target_drop\": 0.05, \"target_queue_load\": 0.7,\n                 \"p_min\": 0.5, \"p_max\": 0.9, \"k_cov\": 0.8, \"k_dps\": 0.05, \"k_drop\": 0.5, \"k_q\": 0.3}\n    )\n    results.append(res)\n\nout_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\nout_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nout_path = out_dir / \"zephyr_v3_multi_server_test.json\"\nwith open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\n\navg_steps = sum(r['steps'] for r in results) / 15\navg_proc = sum(r.get('processed_per_step', 0) for r in results) / 15  # Assuming metric\nprint(f\"Average steps: {avg_steps:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Average processed/step: {avg_proc:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Artifact: {out_path}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON\
    \ SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\nAverage steps: 15.13\nAverage processed/step: 0.00\nArtifact: storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr_v3_multi_server_test.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 31**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.2: Multi-server throughput study\n**ID:** 31\n**Tags:** coordination, adaptive, buffers, multi-server, throughput, reproducibility\n**Abstract:** Adds `servers` to buffered/adaptive models (capacity = service_rate*servers). Compares servers∈{1,2,4} under reliability∈{1.0,0.9} for bidirectional N=24 with immediate service. Reports time_to_full, drops/step, processed/step, and controller modes.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, json, statistics as stats\nfrom pathlib import Path\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\nfrom utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed\nfrom coord.adaptive_buffered_ring\
    \ import run_adaptive_buffered\n\nbase_seed = seed_from_str(\"Axiom-adaptive-buffered-ring-v1.2-multiserver\")\nset_seed(base_seed); _, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\ncfg = {\n    \"N\": 24, \"max_steps\": 500,\n    \"buffer_size\": 8, \"service_rate\": 2, \"servers_list\": [1,2,4],\n    \"serve_after\": False,\n    \"reliabilities\": [1.0, 0.9],\n    \"bidirectional\": True,\n    \"p0\": 0.6,\n    \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": 0.6, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n    \"targets\": {\"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0, \"target_delta\": 0.12, \"target_dps\": 12, \"target_drop\": 0.0, \"target_queue_load\": 0.5,\n                \"k_cov\": 0.8, \"k_dps\": 0.05, \"k_drop\": 0.5, \"k_q\": 0.3},\n    \"replicates\": 12\n}\n\ndef summarize(items):\n    def mean(xs): return float(stats.fmean(xs)) if xs else None\n    t_full = [x[\"steps_to_full\"] for x in items if x[\"steps_to_full\"] is not None]\n    drops_ps = [x[\"dropped\"]/max(1,x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n    proc_ps = [x[\"processed\"\
    ]/max(1,x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n    modes = sorted(list({x[\"controller\"][\"type\"] for x in items}))\n    return {\"time_to_full_mean\": mean(t_full), \"drops_per_step_mean\": mean(drops_ps), \"processed_per_step_mean\": mean(proc_ps), \"controller_modes\": modes}\n\nresults = {}\nfor r in cfg[\"reliabilities\"]:\n    results[str(r)] = {}\n    for srv in cfg[\"servers_list\"]:\n        runs = []\n        for k in range(cfg[\"replicates\"]):\n            seed = mix_seed(base_seed, int(r*1000) + srv*100 + k)\n            runs.append(run_adaptive_buffered(\n                N=cfg[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n                buffer_size=cfg[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=cfg[\"service_rate\"], servers=srv, serve_after=cfg[\"serve_after\"],\n                reliability=r, bidirectional=cfg[\"bidirectional\"],\n                p0=cfg[\"p0\"], sampler_cfg=cfg[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg[\"targets\"], track_history=False\n            ))\n        results[str(r)][str(srv)]\
    \ = summarize(runs)\n\nout_path = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_buffered_ring_v1_2_multiserver.json\")\nout_path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nwith open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump({\"config\": cfg, \"summaries\": results}, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\nprint(\"=== Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.2 (Multi-Server) ===\")\nprint(json.dumps({\"artifact\": str(out_path), \"summaries\": results}, indent=2))\nprint(\"Multi-server study complete.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n=== Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.2 (Multi-Server) ===\n{\n  \"artifact\": \"storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_buffered_ring_v1_2_multiserver.json\",\n  \"summaries\": {\n    \"1.0\": {\n      \"1\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 12.5,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 21.69017094017094,\n        \"controller_modes\"\
